#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:864
msgid "Bé... un més per la col·lecció."
msgstr "Well... one more for the collection."

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:865
msgid "Ah. Val."
msgstr "Ah. Okay."

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:866
msgid "Suposo que compta."
msgstr "I guess it counts."

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:867
msgid "Ni fu ni fa."
msgstr "Meh, could be worse."

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:868
msgid "Almenys no ha costat res."
msgstr "At least it was free."

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:869
msgid "Un clàssic sempre funciona."
msgstr "A classic always works."

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:870
msgid "Sorpresa: cap sorpresa."
msgstr "Surprise: no surprise."

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:871
msgid "Ja en tenia un d'igual. I un altre. I un altre."
msgstr "I already had one just like it. And another. And another."

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:872
msgid "El destí ha parlat, i ha dit \"meh\"."
msgstr "Destiny has spoken, and it said \"meh\"."

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:873
msgid "Segur que a algú li fa il·lusió."
msgstr "I'm sure it's exciting for somebody."

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:874
msgid "Redoblament de tambors... per a això?"
msgstr "A drum roll... for this?"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:875
msgid "Com deia la iaia: no tot poden ser diamants."
msgstr "As grandma used to say: not everything can be a diamond."

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:876
msgid "Tècnicament és una victòria."
msgstr "It's technically a win."

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:877
msgid "La sort no hi era, avui."
msgstr "Luck wasn't around today."

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:878
msgid "Un pas més cap a completar la col·lecció (algun dia)."
msgstr "One step closer to completing the collection (someday)."

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:881
msgid "Ei, no està gens malament!"
msgstr "Hey, that's not bad at all!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:882
msgid "Mira mira, quina sorpresa més agradable!"
msgstr "Well look at that, what a pleasant surprise!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:883
msgid "Això sí que és un bon tirat!"
msgstr "Now that's a good pull!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:884
msgid "M'agrada com sona, això."
msgstr "I like the sound of this."

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:885
msgid "Un pas per sobre de la mitjana, i ja és molt!"
msgstr "A step above average, and that's already a lot!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:886
msgid "Ara sí que comencem a parlar."
msgstr "Now we're talking."

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:887
msgid "Prou bo per presumir-ne una mica."
msgstr "Good enough to brag about a little."

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:888
msgid "Rar de veritat, no rar de \"bé, suposo\"."
msgstr "Actually rare, not \"well, I guess\" rare."

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:889
msgid "Els déus del gacha t'han somrigut avui."
msgstr "The gacha gods have smiled upon you today."

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:890
msgid "Uau, mira com brilla!"
msgstr "Wow, look at it shine!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:891
msgid "Això val la pena ensenyar-ho als amics."
msgstr "This one is worth showing your friends."

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:892
msgid "Bon començament, seguim pujant!"
msgstr "Good start, let's keep climbing!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:893
msgid "Ni el pitjor ni el millor, però queda genial."
msgstr "Not the best, not the worst, but it looks great."

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:894
msgid "Ostres, quina gràcia que ha fet!"
msgstr "Whoa, that was a fun one!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:895
msgid "Ep, ep, ep, mira qui s'ho ha guanyat!"
msgstr "Hey, hey, hey, look who earned that!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:898
msgid "IMPRESSIONANT!! Quina sort!"
msgstr "AMAZING!! What luck!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:899
msgid "AIXÒ SÍ QUE ÉS ÈPIC!"
msgstr "NOW THAT IS EPIC!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:900
msgid "NO M'HO PUC CREURE!!"
msgstr "I CAN'T BELIEVE IT!!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:901
msgid "QUINA BOMBA ACABES DE TREURE!!"
msgstr "WHAT A BOMBSHELL YOU JUST PULLED!!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:902
msgid "ÈPIC DE VERITAT, NO ÈPIC DE MENTIDA!"
msgstr "TRULY EPIC, NOT FAKE-EPIC!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:903
msgid "EL TEU EQUIP ET FELICITARÀ PER AIXÒ!"
msgstr "YOUR TEAM WILL CONGRATULATE YOU FOR THIS!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:904
msgid "AIXÒ SÍ QUE MEREIX UNA CAPTURA DE PANTALLA!"
msgstr "THIS ONE DESERVES A SCREENSHOT!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:905
msgid "INCREÏBLE!! GUARDA'T AQUEST MOMENT!"
msgstr "INCREDIBLE!! SAVE THIS MOMENT!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:906
msgid "HAS DESBLOQUEJAT EL NIVELL \"SORTUT\"!"
msgstr "YOU UNLOCKED \"LUCKY\" LEVEL STATUS!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:907
msgid "QUIN COP DE SORT MÉS BRUTAL!"
msgstr "WHAT A BRUTAL STROKE OF LUCK!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:908
msgid "ELS ALTRES ET TINDRAN ENVEJA, I RAÓ NO ELS FALTARÀ!"
msgstr "EVERYONE ELSE WILL BE JEALOUS, AND RIGHTLY SO!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:909
msgid "AIXÒ ÉS DEL QUE ES PARLA A LA SALA DE PROFESSORAT!"
msgstr "THIS IS WHAT THEY'LL TALK ABOUT IN THE STAFF ROOM!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:910
msgid "HAS GUANYAT LA LOTERIA DEL GACHA!"
msgstr "YOU WON THE GACHA LOTTERY!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:911
msgid "ÈPIC ÉS QUEDAR-SE CURT!"
msgstr "CALLING IT EPIC IS AN UNDERSTATEMENT!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:912
msgid "AIXÒ HAURIA DE SORTIR ALS INFORMATIUS!"
msgstr "THIS SHOULD BE ON THE NEWS!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:915
msgid "★ LLEGENDARI ★ EL MILLOR DIA DE LA TEVA VIDA!!!"
msgstr "★ LEGENDARY ★ THE BEST DAY OF YOUR LIFE!!!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:916
msgid "★★★ ATURA-HO TOT, HAS FET HISTÒRIA!!! ★★★"
msgstr "★★★ STOP EVERYTHING, YOU JUST MADE HISTORY!!! ★★★"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:917
msgid "LES ESTRELLES S'HAN ALINEAT NOMÉS PER TU!!!"
msgstr "THE STARS HAVE ALIGNED JUST FOR YOU!!!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:918
msgid "AIXÒ ÉS LLEGENDA, LITERALMENT!!!"
msgstr "THIS IS LEGEND, LITERALLY!!!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:919
msgid "TRUCA A LA FAMÍLIA, TRUCA ALS AMICS, TRUCA A TOTHOM!!!"
msgstr "CALL YOUR FAMILY, CALL YOUR FRIENDS, CALL EVERYONE!!!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:920
msgid "EL GACHA HA PLORAT D'EMOCIÓ EN DONAR-TE AIXÒ!!!"
msgstr "THE GACHA CRIED TEARS OF JOY GIVING YOU THIS!!!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:921
msgid "AQUEST MOMENT ES RECORDARÀ PER GENERACIONS!!!"
msgstr "THIS MOMENT WILL BE REMEMBERED FOR GENERATIONS!!!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:922
msgid "HAS ARRIBAT AL CIM DE L'OLIMP DEL GACHA!!!"
msgstr "YOU HAVE REACHED THE PEAK OF GACHA OLYMPUS!!!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:923
msgid "NI EN ELS TEUS MILLORS SOMNIS T'HO ESPERAVES!!!"
msgstr "NOT EVEN IN YOUR WILDEST DREAMS DID YOU SEE THIS COMING!!!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:924
msgid "EL SERVIDOR SENCER HAURIA DE SABER-HO, AVUI!!!"
msgstr "THE WHOLE SERVER SHOULD KNOW ABOUT THIS TODAY!!!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:925
msgid "QUE SONIN LES CAMPANES, HAS ACONSEGUIT EL LLEGENDARI!!!"
msgstr "LET THE BELLS RING, YOU GOT THE LEGENDARY!!!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:926
msgid "AIXÒ NO ÉS SORT, ÉS DESTÍ!!!"
msgstr "THIS ISN'T LUCK, IT'S DESTINY!!!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:927
msgid "GUARDA AQUESTA CAPTURA PER SEMPRE!!!"
msgstr "SAVE THIS SCREENSHOT FOREVER!!!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:928
msgid "EL MULTIVERS SENCER T'HA SOMRIGUT AVUI!!!"
msgstr "THE ENTIRE MULTIVERSE SMILED UPON YOU TODAY!!!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:929
msgid "ELS DÉUS DEL CODI T'HAN BENEÏT!!!"
msgstr "THE GODS OF CODE HAVE BLESSED YOU!!!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:952
msgid "Has aconseguit"
msgstr "You got"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:952
msgid "un Sticker!"
msgstr "a Sticker!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:952
msgid "una Icona!"
msgstr "an Icon!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:952
msgid "un Color!"
msgstr "a Color!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:952
msgid "un Tema!"
msgstr "a Theme!"

#: templates/gacha/gacharesult.html:954
